/**
 * Health Intelligence — model-powered synthesis for the Pulse Intel tab.
 *
 * Insights (one document) is generated by
 * composing the full health context (latest labs + active meds + conditions +
 * body-area context + marker trends) and feeding it to the configured model with a
 * tab-specific system prompt. Results are cached in the `health_intel` table
 * so the UI loads instantly; regeneration is explicit (after import or via a
 * dedicated endpoint) rather than lazy-on-read to avoid model costs on
 * every page view.
 *
 * Architecture mirrors dojo's lib/health-intel.js but rebuilt against the
 * robotdojo primitives (getAnthropicClient, the robotdojo health schema,
 * and the migration framework in lib/db.js). No dependency on dojo code.
 */

// INTELLIGENCE_TIER: synthesis — model-powered synthesis of the Pulse Intel
// tabs; the generated prose is persisted and read back by the health UI.
